{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04782","headline":"岳州九日宴道观西阁 · 张说","name":"岳州九日宴道观西阁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"摇落长年叹，蹉跎远宦心。\n北风嘶代马，南浦宿阳禽。\n佳此黄花酌，酣余白首吟。\n凉云霾楚望，蒙雨蔽荆岑。\n登眺思清景，谁将眷浊阴。\n钓歌出江雾，樵唱入山林。\n鱼以嘉名采，木爲美材侵。\n大道由中悟，逍遥匪外寻。\n参佐多君子，词华妙赏音。\n留题洞庭观，望古意何深。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04782.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04782","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}